  "description": "Durable workflow execution abstractions for the Excalibur framework: the deterministic replay context that is the sole boundary for non-deterministic operations, the append-only workflow journal event schema, the at-least-once idempotent activity contract, and the replay-engine executor seam. PRE-RELEASE: the public API is not frozen and may change between pre-release builds. Not recommended for production use. Known issues: https://docs.excalibur-dispatch.dev/docs/known-issues",
